{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And if the Jubilee should come for the children of Israel.</b> That is to say: even when the Jubilee comes, we shall not expect the inheritance to return to us, but it will be permanently added to the inheritance of the tribe, because this is not a sale that returns in the Jubilee — for an inheritance does not return in the Jubilee — and thus it turns out to be added to the inheritance of the tribe that is theirs."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:38:00.665518592Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}